### Lesson 19 — requests for posts-api.js
### VS Code: install "REST Client" (humao.rest-client), then click "Send Request" above each line.
### No extension? Paste the URL into the browser (GET only) or use curl.

@base = http://localhost:3000

### Welcome text
GET {{base}}/

### Health check (JSON)
GET {{base}}/api/health

### All posts (newest first by default)
GET {{base}}/api/posts

### One post
GET {{base}}/api/posts/2

### Not found -> 404
GET {{base}}/api/posts/99

### Not a number -> 400
GET {{base}}/api/posts/abc

### Filter by author (case-insensitive)
GET {{base}}/api/posts?author=Amina

### Search titles
GET {{base}}/api/posts?search=express

### Most liked first
GET {{base}}/api/posts?sort=popular

### Bad sort -> 400
GET {{base}}/api/posts?sort=random

### Page 2, two per page
GET {{base}}/api/posts?page=2&limit=2

### Unknown route -> 404
GET {{base}}/api/nothing-here
